ence":"默认发运方法优先级","my-profile-shipping-del-country":"删除发货国家后，所有国家的默认物流都会清零，请谨慎操作。","my-profile-shipping-del-logistics":"是否要删除默认的物流为“{{name}}\\"?","my-profile-shipping-deleted-successfully":"删除成功","my-profile-shipping-deleting-failed":"删除失败","my-profile-shipping-either-the-cheapest-or-the-fastest-shipping-method-can-be-set-up":"可以为订单类别设置最便宜或最快的运输方式。","my-profile-shipping-how-to-set-default-shipping-method-precedence":"如何设置默认运输方法优先级？","my-profile-shipping-more-details-about":"更多详情:","my-profile-shipping-order-cheapest-shipping-method":"订单-最便宜的运输方式","my-profile-shipping-order-fastest-shipping-method":"订单-最快的运输方法","my-profile-shipping-please-select-a-category-first":"请先选择一个类别。","my-profile-shipping-precedence":"优先级","my-profile-shipping-primary":"主要","my-profile-shipping-product":"产品","my-profile-shipping-quaternary":"第四纪","my-profile-shipping-saved-successfully":"已成功保存","my-profile-shipping-saving-failed":"保存失败","my-profile-shipping-secondary":"次要","my-profile-shipping-store":"商店","my-profile-shipping-sure-del-country":"您确定要删除交货国家/地区选项吗？","my-profile-shipping-tertiary":"第三","my-profile-shipping-you-can-set-up-the-precedence-for-the-3-categories":"您可以为3个类别设置优先级。","my-profile-shipping-you-can-set-up-the-precedence-for-the-4-categories":"您可以为4个类别设置优先级。","my-profile-shipping-you-have-already-added-the-category":"您已经添加了类别。","my-profile-shipping-you-have-already-set-up-the-precedence":"您已经设置了优先级。","my-profile-time":"时间","my-profile-view-results":"查看结果","new-home-1688-recommended-products":"Devinez que vous目标","new-home-1688-sales":"销售","no-data-mobile":"无数据","no-search-test":"请输入关键字","payment-agency-account-service-title":"准备好通过我们的付款帐户服务提高您的销售额了吗？","payment-agency-banner-email":"电子邮件","payment-agency-banner-subtitle":"为您的电子商务业务找到完美的支付解决方案可能很困难。","payment-agency-banner-subtitle-2":"不要让令人沮丧的账户冻结和高准备金要求阻止你的势头。与我们一起获得更好，更简单的解决方案。","payment-agency-banner-title":"访问支付网关，而无需麻烦的商业注册","payment-agency-banner-whatsapp":"WhatsApp","payment-agency-bonus-rewards":"奖金奖励","payment-agency-bo