ular-address-to-select-it-easily":"Tambahkan alamat biasa untuk memilihnya dengan mudah dalam membuat sampel atau pesanan dropshipping.","my-profile-address-add-new-address":"Tambah alamat baru","my-profile-address-address1":"Address1","my-profile-address-address2":"Address2","my-profile-address-are-you-sure-to-delete-this-address":"Anda yakin ingin menghapus alamat ini?","my-profile-address-city":"Kota","my-profile-address-company":"Perusahaan","my-profile-address-consignee-address":"Alamat penerima barang","my-profile-address-consignee-id":"ID penerima barang","my-profile-address-country":"Negara","my-profile-address-county":"County","my-profile-address-default-shipping-address":"Alamat pengiriman Default","my-profile-address-delete-address":"Hapus alamat","my-profile-address-email":"Email","my-profile-address-first-name":"Nama depan","my-profile-address-invalid-phone-please-enter-a-valid-phone":"Telepon tidak valid. Masukkan telepon yang valid.","my-profile-address-invalid-postcode-please-enter-a-valid-postcode":"Kode pos tidak valid. Masukkan kode pos yang valid.","my-profile-address-last-name":"Nama Belakang","my-profile-address-phone-number":"Nomor Telepon","my-profile-address-please-enter-the-address":"Masukkan alamat.","my-profile-address-please-enter-the-first-name":"Masukkan nama depan.","my-profile-address-please-enter-the-last-name":"Masukkan nama belakang.","my-profile-address-please-enter-the-name-of-the-city":"Masukkan nama kota.","my-profile-address-please-enter-the-province-state":"Masukkan provinsi/negara bagian.","my-profile-address-please-select-country":"Pilih negara.","my-profile-address-postcode":"Kode pos","my-profile-address-province":"Provinsi","my-profile-address-region":"Wilayah","my-profile-address-set-as-default-address":"Atur sebagai alamat Default","my-profile-address-set-as-default-consignee":"Atur sebagai penerima Default","my-profile-address-set-as-default-shipping-address":"Atur sebagai alamat pengiriman default","my-profile-addre